#
# Audit item #11 (Publish Security Contact). Deliberately parked outside
# public/ so it is NOT served: security@unitouch.in currently bounces
# ("address not found"), and advertising a contact that black-holes reports
# is worse than advertising none.
#
# To ship: create the security@unitouch.in alias in Google Workspace (the
# domain already has Google MX records), or swap the Contact line for an
# address that is actually monitored, then move this file to
# public/.well-known/security.txt and redeploy.

# Security contact for unitouch.in
